0	section	Talking to the Squire
1	line	Squire	Hello. I am the squire to Sir Vyvin.
1	option	And how is life as a squire?
2	line	Player	And how is life as a squire?
2	line	Squire	Well, Sir Vyvin is a good guy to work for, however, I'm in a spot of trouble today. I've gone and lost Sir Vyvin's sword!
2	option	Do you know where you lost it?
3	line	Player	Do you know where you lost it?
3	line	Squire	Well now, if I knew THAT it wouldn't be lost, now would it?
3	option	Well, do you know the VAGUE AREA you lost it?
4	line	Player	Well, do you know the VAGUE AREA you lost it in?
4	line	Squire	No. I was carrying it for him all the way from where he had it stored in Lumbridge. It must have slipped from my pack during the trip, and you know what people are like these days...
4	line	Squire	Someone will have just picked it up and kept it for themselves.
4	option	I can make a new sword if you like...
5	action	below
4	option	Well, the kingdom is fairly abundant with swords...
