2	line	Thurgo	By Guthix! THAT was good pie! Anyone who makes pie like THAT has got to be alright!
2	option	Can you make a special sword for me?
3	line	Player	Can you make a special sword for me?
3	line	Thurgo	Well, after bringing me my favorite food I guess I should give it a go. What sort of sword is it?
3	line	Player	I need you to make a sword for one of Falador's knights. He had one which was passed down through five generations, but his squire has lost it.
3	line	Player	So we need an identical one to replace it.
3	line	Thurgo	A knight's sword eh? Well, I'd need to know exactly how it looked before I could make a new one.
3	line	Thurgo	All the Faladian knights used to have swords with unique designs according to their position. Could you bring me a picture or something?
3	line	Player	I'll go and ask his squire and see if I can find one.
