2	line	Thurgo	You'll need to get me some stuff to make this. I'll need two iron bars to make the sword, to start with. I'll also need an ore called blurite.
2	line	Thurgo	Blurite is useless for making actual weapons, except crossbows, but I'll need some as decoration for the hilt.
2	line	Thurgo	It is a fairly rare ore. The only place I know to get it is under this cliff here, but it is guarded by a very powerful ice giant.
2	line	Thurgo	Most of the rocks in that cliff are pretty useless, and don't contain much of anything, but there's DEFINITELY some blurite in there.
2	line	Thurgo	You'll need a little bit of mining experience to be able to find it.
2	line	Player	Okay. I'll go and find them then.
2	action	end
